 * (the allowed characters for media type tokens).  The validation now uses a
 * whitelist of characters rather than a blacklist, rejecting any control
 * characters, whitespace, or characters that are not part of the token set.
 * This prevents injection of newlines or other illegal characters into HTTP
 * headers.</p>
